== Acquisition ==
This [[Cosmetics#Capes and Cards|cosmetic set]], found on page 1st of the [[Ironclad Democracy Premium Warbond]], can be claimed separately for {{Currency|Medals|8|notext}} and {{Currency|Medals|2}} respectively.

